<title>NETHERLANDS: ING BARINGS RAISES VOLKER STEVIN TO BUY.</title>
<headline>ING BARINGS RAISES VOLKER STEVIN TO BUY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 11 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Volker Stevin   Construction  139.00  ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Hold). Estimates raised after first-half</p>
<p>figures are better than expected, viewed as a strong achievement</p>
<p>given the long winter. Stock is strongly geared towards Dutch</p>
<p>infrastructure, which is seen as a very promising market.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   12.65    11.35    n/a	n/a</p>
<p>    1997		   14.00    12.90    n/a	n/a</p>
